{"title":"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/3/7e3cefd73ff5fd35b102779501f78609eda325ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = (1+i)^{17} - (1-i)^{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"189\" height=\"19\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/9/75952e52a3dc061d24146c0df9062a54a5ce5a5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i=\\sqrt{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"21\" />. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/c/11ceba9d7455309f60178fe82bb6e81e6c01fa83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|S|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rewriting the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Complex_number\" title=\"Complex number\">complex numbers</a> in polar notation form, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/6/df60b6ce7b60a9faefe829872d4cde06699b5d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+i = \\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{cis}\\,\\frac{\\pi}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"124\" height=\"33\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/a/bba775555998c871cd8d848b93e108030de3b475.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-i = \\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{cis}\\,-\\frac{\\pi}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"146\" height=\"33\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/a/0aa509650ce1c631b4ca830dc6c9fd559c7c1956.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{cis}\\,\\theta = \\cos \\theta + i\\sin \\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"156\" height=\"14\" />. By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=De_Moivre%27s_Theorem\" title=\"De Moivre&#39;s Theorem\">De Moivre's Theorem</a>, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/8/79867d703166170eb8ad773a0383b65941927cd7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\left(\\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{cis}\\,\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)^{17} - \\left(\\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{cis}\\,-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)^{17} &amp;= 2^{17/2}\\,\\left(\\text{cis}\\,\\frac{17\\pi}{4}\\right) - 2^{17/2}\\,\\left(\\text{cis}\\,-\\frac{17\\pi}{4}\\right) \\\\ &amp;= 2^{17/2}\\left[\\text{cis}\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) - \\text{cis}\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\right] \\\\ &amp;= 2^{17/2}\\left(2i\\sin \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) \\\\ &amp;= 2^{17/2} \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2^{-1/2}i = 2^9i = \\boxed{512}\\,i \\end{align*}\" width=\"552\" height=\"152\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008\">Mock AIME 1 2007-2008</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=196980\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018035645\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 107/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1442/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 200/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1822/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.890      1 Template:Mock_AIME_box\n100.00%    7.890      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6652:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018035645 and revision id 24496. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}